WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Carlos Ibarra: First article inspection passed all critical dimensions on the new injection mold.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Theo Marsh: How did the short-run capability study come out?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Carlos Ibarra: Cpk came in at one point four eight on the critical wall thickness dimension.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Linda Park: That clears our threshold, I'm comfortable approving production release.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Carlos Ibarra: I'll finalize the preventive maintenance plan for the new tool before we schedule the first run.
